B.agj=s(["Reduced the worCat header, page padding, and bottom navigation height on phones while preserving iOS safe areas.","Manual ledger creation now shows only income and expense; supported pay-later methods are marked as advance expenses automatically.","Credit card bill and loan repayments remain normal expenses and reduce the linked advance expense balance.","Advance tracking now displays remaining versus the month opening obligation, including the correct cross-month carryover."],t.s)
